{"lines":[{"x":0.12959989674014333,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11486035664876301,"h":0.016861002443685713,"y":0.063517173179936437},{"t":"MARTHA:","c":1,"h":0.010283594813104369,"y":0.11331750490129888,"w":0.058302485148111954,"x":0.12968334379169805},{"w":0.03759398460388183,"c":1,"h":0.0087209303610875644,"t":"ALEX:","x":0.13157894745369816,"y":0.12936046503021204},{"h":0.011888377526768967,"c":1,"t":"MARTHA:","y":0.15975348562397917,"x":0.12965611316824222,"w":0.058356946309407576},{"c":1,"h":0.011062209405057866,"t":"ALEX:","x":0.12951483660050508,"y":0.17542819759394135,"w":0.039842507044474285},{"x":0.12961361748599265,"w":0.058441937764485669,"y":0.25400542215943578,"h":0.0094310161150891192,"c":1,"t":"MARTHA:"},{"x":0.12781954895745756,"c":1,"t":"ALEX:","y":0.27034883725958581,"w":0.03759398460388183,"h":0.010174418447559619},{"c":1,"t":"MARTHA:","x":0.12966199102717549,"h":0.0090228103470664234,"y":0.28618626923003343,"w":0.058345190684000653},{"x":0.22180450554253922,"w":0.4003759511311849,"h":0.015988372635703296,"t":"I am not sure what I should wear. What do you think?","y":0.11191860437603407,"c":1},{"y":0.12732695499045854,"w":0.63925053914388019,"x":0.22172663448698529,"c":1,"t":"Nothing too casual - like jeans, for example. If you've got a nice jacket, wear that Q8","h":0.019110288454192048},{"x":0.22150892871240718,"c":1,"y":0.1424755793665059,"w":0.17360143025716146,"h":0.016116072881321553,"t":"with a skirt or trousers."},{"x":0.22180450941549121,"y":0.15840309079974924,"h":0.014562025272838564,"w":0.21240601857503252,"c":1,"t":"OK. Thanks. Any other tips?"},{"w":0.59435414632161465,"t":"Erm, well I know it's really obvious but arrive in plenty of time. They hate people","c":1,"h":0.022886304493036413,"x":0.22348092754517637,"y":0.1714233062203192},{"h":0.018935351546779389,"y":0.18984437855098768,"c":1,"x":0.22171738775573033,"w":0.65240173339843743,"t":"who are late. So make sure you know exactly where you have to get to. And one. Q10"},{"t":"other useful piece of advice my manager told me before I had the interview for","w":0.58476760864257815,"x":0.22172187744930133,"h":0.017892539079006564,"y":0.20575031876735173,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.22119621265151812,"w":0.57727030436197913,"x":0.21982485488876932,"t":"this job - is to smile. Even if you feel terrified. It makes people respond better","h":0.018017754121818497},{"w":0.053174765904744459,"t":"to you.","c":1,"x":0.22146509501821809,"h":0.011153916888903326,"y":0.23903614499449866},{"c":1,"x":0.21992480830304525,"t":"Ill have to practise doing that in the mirror!","y":0.25290697646811577,"w":0.32142857869466146,"h":0.015988372635703296},{"y":0.26697436164832622,"t":"Yeah - well, good luck. Let me know if you need any more information.","x":0.22163683877878063,"c":1,"w":0.52852488199869796,"h":0.020361145618878362},{"x":0.22145417300052239,"y":0.28414245340422228,"t":"Thanks very much.","w":0.14351320902506509,"h":0.016254018524425318,"c":1},{"y":0.33284883706944701,"h":0.01744186072217524,"w":0.1484962463378906,"x":0.12781954591000205,"c":1,"t":"SECTION 2"},{"y":0.36317746065426992,"x":0.12773723535227183,"w":0.66368810017903646,"h":0.018168504669523577,"c":1,"t":"Hi everyone, welcome to the Snow Centre. My name's Annie. I hope you enjoyed the bus"},{"h":0.019863845913623557,"w":0.66192209879557296,"c":1,"t":"trip from the airport - we've certainly got plenty of snow today! Well, you've come to New","x":0.12580341316503013,"y":0.37764632543405374},{"c":1,"x":0.12581339765092034,"t":"Zealand's premier snow and ski centre, and we've a whole load of activities for you during","h":0.019506858535835336,"y":0.39382690352045557,"w":0.66940902709960937},{"w":0.12406014760335288,"t":"your week here.","y":0.41133720934423879,"x":0.12593985089232598,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.66381546020507809,"y":0.43215343372469084,"x":0.12578478799279036,"t":"Most visitors come here for the cross-country skiing, where you're on fairly flat ground for","h":0.020426117061263627},{"w":0.68066624959309896,"h":0.019142895764254431,"t":"most of the time, rather than going down steep mountainsides. There are marked trails, but","x":0.1258338197223543,"c":1,"y":0.44882305019586544},{"y":0.46378493204948201,"w":0.68254430135091138,"t":"you can also leave these and go off on your own and that's an experience not to be missed.","h":0.01926080933403207,"c":1,"x":0.12397512828428432},{"x":0.12578252530820067,"c":1,"w":0.66945917765299479,"y":0.47957673647489851,"t":"You can go at your own speed - it's great aerobic exercise if you really push yourself, or if","h":0.020162082532107717},{"c":1,"t":"you prefer you can just glide gently along and enjoy the beautiful scenery.","x":0.12396744718185754,"y":0.49638790698182578,"w":0.55095321655273444,"h":0.018224328084676666},{"t":"This afternoon, you'll be going on a dog-sled trip. You may have seen our dogs on TV","w":0.63559377034505204,"y":0.51963828195434636,"h":0.019368812182758655,"c":1,"x":0.12579578453411405},{"x":0.12395077666003526,"t":"recently racing in the winter sled festival. If you want, you can have your own team for the","w":0.66749949137369791,"c":1,"h":0.018021146328466076,"y":0.53606178483079847},{"t":"Q12","y":0.53924418606275648,"w":0.03571428616841632,"x":0.82894736810587633,"h":0.013081395234588844,"c":1},{"x":0.12394475144127066,"h":0.01957380671848119,"c":1,"w":0.66563990275065099,"t":"afternoon and learn how to drive them, following behind our leader on the trail. Or if you'd","y":0.55074134205268865},{"c":1,"w":0.54908762613932294,"x":0.12396597001738674,"t":"prefer, you can just sit back in the sled and enjoy the ride as a passenger.","y":0.56689767279354308,"h":0.018441494403158676},{"c":1,"x":0.1239647854183723,"y":0.59057681466877132,"h":0.018485144807382059,"t":"At the weekend, we have the team relay event, and you're all welcome to join in. We have a","w":0.68439798990885414},{"x":0.12207212818060441,"t":"local school coming along, and a lot of the teachers are taking part too. Participation rather","c":1,"y":0.60695399980320441,"w":0.67689361572265627,"h":0.017634380117049209},{"w":0.73898503621419276,"y":0.62203692140363454,"h":0.020576988583753342,"c":1,"t":"than winning is the main focus, and there's a medal for everyone who takes part. Participants Q13","x":0.12391342594208102},{"x":0.1238935929204347,"h":0.021249524255913421,"c":1,"y":0.63581919843686197,"t":"are in teams of two to four, and each team must complete four laps of the course.","w":0.60567942301432298},{"h":0.018686303766942136,"c":1,"t":"For your final expedition, you'll head off to Mount Frenner wearing a pair of special snow","y":0.66096476684331484,"x":0.12393762971521369,"w":0.65812398274739581},{"h":0.017899671064525391,"y":0.67692423501345422,"t":"shoes which allow you to walk on top of the snow. This is an area where miners once","w":0.63369415283203123,"c":1,"x":0.12207173496144387},{"t":"searched for gold, though there are very few traces of their work left now. When the snow","x":0.12218044576084841,"y":0.6931745012169207,"h":0.016127824629803889,"c":1,"w":0.66729324340820317},{"c":1,"w":0.68067428588867185,"h":0.018861378843524901,"y":0.70829638196569389,"x":0.12208628953831711,"t":"melts in summer, the mountain slopes are carpeted in flowers and plants. It's a long ascent,"},{"h":0.016198877357930019,"c":1,"t":"Q14","y":0.71137730534368537,"x":0.82582104070619078,"w":0.038207543690999324},{"t":"though not too steep, and walkers generally take a couple of days to get to the summit","w":0.64307230631510415,"x":0.12207223703455801,"y":0.72502566312000116,"h":0.018127327800487869,"c":1},{"w":0.67321919759114579,"x":0.1220271360162125,"t":"You'll spend the night in our hut half-way up the mountain. That's included in your package","h":0.019981892739889706,"c":1,"y":0.76268972553598346},{"h":0.01929533688851659,"w":0.64122762044270842,"c":1,"t":"for the stay. It's got cooking facilities, firewood and water for drinking. For washing, we","y":0.77891186222596942,"x":0.12016843899030931},{"t":"recommend you use melted snow, though, to conserve supplies. We can take your luggage","y":0.79505828091369424,"w":0.68063390096028653,"h":0.01906952547858165,"x":0.12021408595891539,"c":1},{"t":"up on our snowmobile for you for just ten dollars a person. The hut has cooking facilities so","w":0.67497370402018231,"h":0.017505877876158871,"y":0.81135294731459695,"x":0.12210209302903688,"c":1},{"w":0.67505177815755213,"h":0.019496555414341032,"c":1,"x":0.12018933910233613,"y":0.82651379610879616,"t":"you can make a hot meal in the evening and morning, but you need to take your own food."},{"y":0.84990992726651626,"c":1,"x":0.12206078625913913,"h":0.018194115092811214,"t":"The weather on Mount Frenner can be very stormy. In that case, stay in the hut - generally","w":0.67881088256835942},{"h":0.018534070203477748,"w":0.68253621419270838,"t":"the storms don't last long. Don't stress about getting back here to the centre in time to catch","y":0.86620506819025911,"x":0.12018817019061979,"c":1},{"h":0.019464801068622251,"y":0.88088390205284495,"x":0.12017191720454842,"c":1,"w":0.67883677164713541,"t":"the airport bus - they'll probably not be running anyway. We do have an emergency locator"},{"x":0.1201784169287608,"w":0.66005294799804681,"y":0.89634024995734951,"c":1,"t":"beacon in the hut but only use that if it's a real emergency, like if someone's ill or injured.","h":0.019846163330274669},{"w":0.033834587732950894,"h":0.013081395234588733,"x":0.82706766844555446,"c":1,"t":"Q15","y":0.78343023257892652},{"x":0.12030075156452304,"y":0.95203488387544355,"h":0.014534883321060788,"w":0.035714286168416334,"c":1,"t":"114"}],"w":2400,"h":3106}